						</div>
					</div>

					<article class="personal-story-section">
						<h2 class="story-heading">My BMS Story</h2>
						<div class="story-lead">
							<p>
								In early 2025, I woke up with a searing sensation like a boiling spoon pressed against my tongue. Within weeks, the daily burning escalated to an agonizing 10/10 that made speaking and eating feel like dragging raw tissue across&nbsp;sandpaper.
							</p>
							<p>
								After consulting five dentists and five medical doctors who ran extensive tests only to tell me everything looked completely normal, I realized traditional medicine had no clear solution for my&nbsp;condition.
							</p>
							<p>
								I decided to treat my body like an engineering system. Through rigorous tracking, gentle nighttime mouth taping, and targeted nutritional protocols, I systematically brought my burning symptoms from a 10/10 down to&nbsp;0/10.
							</p>
							<p class="continue-reading-p">
								<a href="/about" class="continue-reading-link">Continue reading &rarr;</a>
							</p>
						</div>
					</article>
				</section>

				<section class="section-header recent-posts-header">
					<h2 class="recent-posts-title">Recent Posts</h2>
					<p class="recent-posts-subtitle">Here is what I've written about, the experiments I've conducted, and what I've discovered along the&nbsp;way.</p>
				</section>

				<div class="grid">
					<article class="card">
						<a href="/blog/carnivore-doctors-youtube/">
							<div class="card-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80')"></div>
							<div class="card-body">
								<div class="card-meta">
									<span class="meta-entry">Entry 1</span>
									<span class="meta-date"><FormattedDate date={demoDate} /></span>
								</div>
								<h3>Carnivore Diet & BMS: What 12 Doctors Discovered</h3>
								<p>Exploring the neurological connection between metabolic inflammation and chronic mucosal burning.</p>
								<span class="view-story">Read More →</span>
							</div>
						</a>
					</article>
				</div>

				<div style="text-align: center; margin: 2.5rem 0;">
					<a href="/blog" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 0.85rem 2.25rem;">View All Entries +</a>
				</div>

				<section class="newsletter-section newsletter-dark">
					<h2>Stay Updated on my progress</h2>
					<p>Let's use the collective wisdom to solve BMS for more&nbsp;people.</p>
					<a href="/join" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 1rem 2.75rem; font-size: 1.05rem; color: #ffffff !important;">Stay updated &rarr;</a>
				</section>
			</main>
